Some words have special meanings in R and should not normally be used as variable names.

Important reserved keywords from the manual include:

for
in
repeat
while
function
if
else
next
break
TRUE
FALSE
NULL
Inf
NaN
NA

The manual also lists:

NA_integer_
NA_real_
