NA_character_

6. SPECIAL VALUES IN R

These are very important for viva.

Value	Meaning
NA	Not Available / missing value
NULL	Missing or undefined value
NaN	Not a Number
TRUE	Logical true
FALSE	Logical false
Inf	Infinity
Examples
0/0

Output:

